  "text": "proprium.transfiguratio-domini-postcommunio",
  "about": "The postcommunio of the formulary “Transfiguration of Our Lord” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": {
      "translation": "Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that by the understanding of our minds made pure, we may grasp the mystery of the Transfiguration of Your only-begotten Son, which we celebrate by these solemn rites. Through the same our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen."
    }
  },
